---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Sports Complex" 
  subtitle="Fostering physical discipline and competitive excellence."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4805.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Campus', href: '/campus' },
    { label: 'Sports Complex', href: '/campus/sports' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Recreational Facilities</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      At FUAZ, we recognize the importance of physical fitness to academic success. The University Sports Complex is a multi-million-naira facility featuring standard pitches, tracks, and indoor arenas used for both recreational exercise and inter-university competitions (NUGA).
    </p>

    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Available Arenas</h2>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li>Standard FIFA-sized football pitch with synthetic turf and a 5,000-capacity grandstand.</li>
      <li>Twin outdoor basketball and volleyball courts.</li>
      <li>An 8-lane tartan athletic track for sprints and distance running.</li>
      <li>Indoor sports hall for badminton, table tennis, and martial arts practice.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class={styles.importantBox}>
      <strong>Vice-Chancellor's Cup:</strong> The annual inter-college football tournament kicks off in the second semester. All students are encouraged to register through their departmental sports directors.
    </div>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
